---
const includes = [
  "A website built from scratch, not a template",
  "A Google Ads account built from zero",
  "One automation from first inquiry to booked job",
  "Live in 30 days from your last file",
  "Two rounds of revisions",
];
---

<section class="section pricing" id="pricing">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pricing__head">
      <h2 data-reveal>What it costs</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:120ms">
        One build fee, then a monthly to run it. No packages, no hourly billing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing__grid">
      <div class="pricing__rates">
        <div class="rate rate--founding" data-reveal>
          <p class="rate__price">$1,000 to build</p>
          <p class="rate__price">$500 a month to run it</p>
          <p class="rate__terms">First three clients only. Three month minimum on the monthly.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="pricing__note" data-reveal style="--delay:80ms">
          Three at this price, then it goes to list. I am one person, and 30 days means 30 days.
        </p>

        <div class="rate rate--list" data-reveal style="--delay:140ms">
          <p class="rate__price">$2,500 to build</p>
          <p class="rate__price">$800 a month to run it</p>
          <p class="rate__terms">After the first three.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing__detail">
        <div class="pricing__block" data-reveal style="--delay:100ms">
          <h3>What the build includes</h3>
          <ul class="pricing__list">
            {includes.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing__block" data-reveal style="--delay:160ms">
          <h3>What you pay for directly</h3>
          <p>
            Your domain, website platform, ad spend, and automation hosting. All in your name, on
            your card. I never mark up software or ad spend.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="pricing__why" data-reveal>
      The monthly covers what does not sit still. An ads account left alone pays more for less.
      Logins expire. Platforms change. I watch it and fix it before you notice.
    </p>

    <p class="pricing__warranty" data-reveal>
      12 month warranty. If something I built stops working, I fix it free. New features and
      changes made by third parties are quoted separately. I do not guarantee ad results. Nobody
      honest does.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing {
    background: var(--haze);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .pricing__head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
  }

  .pricing__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .pricing__rates {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .rate {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .rate--founding {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .rate--founding .rate__price {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .rate__terms {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--mute);
  }

  .pricing__note {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.66;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .rate--list {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .rate--list .rate__price {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--mute);
  }

  .rate--list .rate__terms {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .pricing__detail {
    display: grid;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .pricing__block {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .pricing__block h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .pricing__block p {
    color: var(--mute);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .pricing__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .pricing__list li {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing__list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.75em;
    width: 9px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--blue);
  }

  .pricing__why {
    margin-top: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
    padding-top: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    color: var(--mute);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  .pricing__warranty {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.7vw, 1.45rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .pricing__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
